  older than the code set which types it.

  SettlMethod is drawn from the real repository, where field 1039 UnderlyingSettlMethod is dated FIX.4.4 and the
  SettlMethodCodeSet that types it FIX.5.0 - so every cut from FIX.4.4 up to FIX.5.0 as published keeps the field
  and removes its code set.
-->
